// logs/audit_log.jsonl
// Append-only audit log. One JSON object per line (JSONL format).
// Written by write_audit_log() in tools/governance.py after every answered query.
// Never edited, truncated, or deleted — append only.
// Each entry contains:
//   session_id, user_id, timestamp, query, route, escalated,
//   chunks_used (list of source_file + section for every chunk),
//   situation_facts, final_answer, grounding_score, compliance_passed
// This file is the complete paper trail for every answer the system has ever given.
// Do not commit to git — logs/ is in .gitignore.